The file descriptors are stored to ensure proper cleanup when the program finishes executing. Memory leaks have been avoided by freeing any allocated buffers before closing files. The function uses a mutex to synchronize access to shared resources across threads. This ensures thread safety while minimizing overhead due to synchronization mechanisms.
